{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1304679-i-created-some-new-clauses-in-my-goblin-contracts","id":1304679,"title":"I created some new \"Clauses\" in my goblin contracts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-13T13:04:55-07:00","id":1304679,"title":"I created some new \"Clauses\" in my goblin contracts","content":"The Idea was that Goblin contracts are supposed to be trick things, so I got the Idea that paying more goblin debt can awaken hidden &quot;Clauses&quot; of said contract.<br /> <br /> Example: A Goblin contract has the power to &quot;Dispel&quot; other contracts so at the end of it I put \u201cOptional: The Changeling can receive + 2 Goblin Debt to make this contract also affect other supernatural powers\u201d.<br /> <br /> I wanted to make goblin contracts more versatile but still trick, like 1 goblin debt is not that much, but 3 is just enough to make my players consider the options with care.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25121-oniverse","name":"Oniverse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25121_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}